			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Limits and Continuity:\n\n- [x] **2.2 HW: Limit of a Function and Limit Laws**\n- [ ] **2.4 HW One-Sided Limits**\n- [ ] **HW Limits Involving Infinity; Asymptotes of Graphs**\n- [ ]  **2.6 HW Continuity**\n\n---\n### Differentiation:\n\n- [ ] **3.1 Tangent Lines and the Derivative at a Point**\n- [ ] **Homework 3.3 HW Differentiation Rules**\n- [ ] **Homework 3.5 Derivatives of Trigonometric Functions**\n- [ ] **Homework 3.6 The Chain Rule**\n- [ ] **Homework 3.7 Implicit Differentiation**\n- [ ] **Homework 3.8 Derivatives of Inverse Functions and Logarithms**\n- [ ] **Homework 3.9 Inverse Trigonometric Functions**\n---\n### Applications of Derivatives:\n\n- [ ] **Homework 4.1 Extreme Values of Functions on Closed Intervals**\n- [ ] **Homework 4.3 Monotonic Functions and the First Derivative Test**\n- [ ] **Homework 4.4 Concavity and Curve Sketching**\n- [ ] **Homework 4.5 Indeterminate Forms and L'Hopital's Rule**\n---\n### Integration:\n\n- [ ] **Homework 4.8 Antiderivatives** ✅ 2024-12-27\n- [ ] **Homework 5.4 The Fundamental Theorem of Calculus**\n- [ ] **Homework 5.5 Indefinite Integrals and the Substitution Method**",
